From b05bb757be21aadb7524da142a91992b8040e1f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MasterVitte <mentorvitte@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:45:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] perf(virtual-core): rebuild measurements from the first
 changed key

When only `count` or `getItemKey` changes, a single-lane list keeps the
previous build up to the first index whose key differs and rebuilds from
there, instead of from index 0. Appending a page to a long list or
inserting into its middle no longer re-estimates the unchanged prefix.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
